SUMMARY:Part Closure: DISTRICT LINE: Saturday 19 and Sunday 20 September\, 
 no service between Earls Court and Ealing Broadway / Richmond. Use MILDMAY
  LINE services where available between Gunnersbury\, Kew Gardens and 
 Richmond. Replacement buses operate.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTAMP:20260919T085827Z
