SUMMARY:Part Closure: PICCADILLY LINE: Saturday 19 September\, from 0130 
 and all day Sunday 20 September\, including Night Tube\, no service 
 between Hyde Park Corner and Acton Town. Replacement buses operate. Use 
 ELIZABETH LINE trains for travel between Central London and Heathrow.
